This repository contains the updated and refactored version of the legacy loan calculator project as required in ISE Assignment-2.


1. Project Clean-Up

Removed old Qt GUI files and unnecessary or deprecated files
Cleaned project structure


2.New Project Structure

├── src/
│   ├── Loan.cpp
│   ├── Loan.h
│   ├── main.cpp
│
├── test/
│   ├── LoanTest.cpp
│
├── config.txt
├── Doxyfile
├── Report.pdf
└── README.md

3.Hardcoded Values Removed

Added config.txt
Code now reads configuration from file instead of hard-coding values


4.Input Validation & Error Handling

Implemented validation for Negative values and Overflow


5.Unit Testing

Used GoogleTest

Added LoanTest.cpp

Tests implemented are Normal EMI calculation, Invalid input handling and Large tenure boundary

All tests passed successfully

6.Documentation

Used Doxygen

Added Doxyfile

Doxygen comments added to .h and .cpp files

Generates documentation automatically using doxygen Doxyfile


7.Final Report

Added Report.pdf summarizing

